function touch_all_l [#"/home/cornel/fv-runs/memory-tier-d14dfb9a/components/memory-tier/verif-creusot/src/lib.rs" 1380 0 1380 71] (t: Seq.seq tup2_u64_u64) (ks: Seq.seq UInt64.t) : Seq.seq tup2_u64_u64

